<title>UK: TABLE- Chrysalis returns to H1 profits.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Chrysalis returns to H1 profits.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to February 28.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		  6.19		 vs  - 9.35</p>
<p> Pretax			 1.5		  vs  - 2.9</p>
<p> Turnover		    52.5		  vs   46.8</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said a dividend for 1996 was paid on April 8, 1997 and it intends to announce the 1997 dividend with the final results.</p>
<p>Full company name -  Chrysalis Group Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
